The pascal/kext tree is licensed GPL-2.0-only.

It is a macOS (XNU/IOKit) kernel-extension skeleton derived from nouveau
concepts; nouveau's nvkm is GPL-2.0-only, so this tree must be GPL-2.0-only
as well (HANDOFF-PASCAL.md §3). The full license text is
https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.txt

This tree must never be merged with, compiled into, or distributed together
with the repository's PolyForm-NC components (kexts/, plugin/, translator/);
see pascal/kext/README.md ("Licensing").
